thrm{ZF}^{-}\\in V\">\\(M,L_{\\in},\\mathrm{ZF}^{-}\\in V\\)</span>, where <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_{\\in}\">\\(L_{\\in}\\)</span> is the first-order language of set theory and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZF}^{-}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZF}^{-}\\)</span> is ZF without Power Set</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcModel9CountablyClosedModel}_S\\subseteq V\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcModel9CountablyClosedModel}_S\\subseteq V\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Function}\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"36d7463d215be751\" href=\"?note=36d7463d215be751\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-function.md\">../batch16/58-df-function.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Model}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{Model}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"923884eb8fe4e61d\" href=\"?note=923884eb8fe4e61d\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-model.md\">../batch09/58-df-model.md</a>) and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\">\\(\\mathrm{Univ}:V\\to V\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d9b8711cda3f31ca\" href=\"?note=d9b8711cda3f31ca\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-structure.md\">../batch18/58-df-structure.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"L_{\\in}\\coloneqq\\mathcal L_{\\in}\">\\(L_{\\in}\\coloneqq\\mathcal L_{\\in}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZF}^{-}=\\mathrm{ZF}\\setminus\\{\\mathrm{PowerSetAxiom}_{58}\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZF}^{-}=\\mathrm{ZF}\\setminus\\{\\mathrm{PowerSetAxiom}_{58}\\}\\)</span> 使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc.md\">58-ax-zfc.md</a> 中的句子集定义。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model9\\text{-}countably\\text{-}closed\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel9CountablyClosedModel}_S(M)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Model}_S(M,\\mathrm{ZF}^{-},L_{\\in})\n\\land\\forall f\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,\\mathrm{Univ}(M))\n\\to f\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}model9\\text{-}countably\\text{-}closed\\text{-}model}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcModel9CountablyClosedModel}_S(M)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Model}_S(M,\\mathrm{ZF}^{-},L_{\\in})\n\\land\\forall f\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Function}(f,\\omega,\\mathrm{Univ}(M))\n\\to f\\in\\mathrm{Univ}(M)\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Auxiliary countable closure definition.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-function.md","status":"resolved","id":"36d7463d215be751","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-function.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch09/58-df-model.md","status":"resolved","id":"923884eb8fe4e61d","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch09/58-df-model.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-structure.md","status":"resolved","id":"d9b8711cda3f31ca","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[..